    "sections": {
        "description": "The Videographer Portfolio Theme provides a structured website layout designed for displaying videos, images, written content, and project information in an organized format. It features responsive pages, customizable homepage sections, portfolio layouts, blog integration, contact sections, testimonials, and social media support. Video embedding options allow multimedia content to be displayed directly within different page sections. The theme includes flexible customization settings for colors, fonts, headers, footers, backgrounds, logos, and navigation menus. Responsive design ensures consistent presentation across desktop computers, tablets, and smartphones. Built with clean coding practices, it supports faster loading, translation readiness, widget areas, and compatibility with commonly used plugins. Several page templates help organize galleries, featured content, announcements, and contact details without requiring complex configuration. Banner sections, call-to-action blocks, and footer layouts provide additional flexibility when arranging content. The overall design emphasizes readability, balanced spacing, and straightforward navigation, allowing multimedia and written information to remain the primary focus while maintaining a consistent browsing experience across various devices and screen sizes."
    },
